plugins/sefi-core/skills/n8n-workflow-design/SKILL.md	All factual output follows the anti-hallucination skill: cite or mark UNKNOWN, never guess
plugins/sefi-core/skills/technical-writing/SKILL.md	All factual output follows the anti-hallucination skill: every command, path, flag, and number is verified against the repo or an executed output -- or marked UNKNOWN, never guessed
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/human-checkpoint.md	A loop, agent, or automation never auto-merges, never force-pushes, never deploys to production
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/human-checkpoint.md	An autonomous retry budget hides a bad call inside more automation
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/loop-discipline.md	A loop or repeated cycle obeys its own stop conditions, escalation thresholds, and state precedence rules exactly, every cycle, with no silent skip and no silent scope-widening
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/loop-discipline.md	SKIP, degrade, and escalate are logged conclusions the loop reaches deliberately, never omissions it drifts into
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/loop-discipline.md	The four predecessor-earned rules -- consume-before-act, non-retryable harness-limit notices, the metrics append after every verdict, and per-operation timeout classes -- are each a specific, previously-violated discipline rule now made explicit
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/scope-boundary.md	Being unable to perform an action is not permission to perform it a different way
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/references/scope-boundary.md	A deliverable that belongs to another agent is a contract violation even when it is correct, even when it is good
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/SKILL.md	Write the handoff as an envelope and gate it before dispatching
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/SKILL.md	A blocked envelope is fixed and re-checked, never dispatched anyway
plugins/sefi-core/skills/sefi-orchestration/SKILL.md	Each stage's output file must be self-contained
plugins/sefi-core/agents/qa-engineer.md	Apply the delete-the-line test: if reverting the change would not fail a test or visibly break the flow you exercised, it is not integrated -- REJECT as unwired
plugins/sefi-core/agents/qa-engineer.md	THIS CODE IS BROKEN until executed evidence proves otherwise
plugins/sefi-core/agents/qa-engineer.md	Every fix you PASS must leave a regression test that asserts the specific failure mode traced during the fix
